WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.928
The next morning we went rowing on the lake.

2
00:00:05.929 --> 00:00:09.411
Then we played games in the Lake Lounge.

3
00:00:09.412 --> 00:00:14.508
"It's time to pack up and go home," said Mr. Chen after lunch.

4
00:00:14.509 --> 00:00:19.386
Jenny moaned. "Do we have to leave so soon?"

5
00:00:19.387 --> 00:00:23.286
"We've had so much fun here!" said Josh.

6
00:00:23.287 --> 00:00:25.587
I knew how Josh felt.

7
00:00:25.588 --> 00:00:31.499
We'd had a wonderful time at Shadow Lake Lodge.

8
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.616
And there were so many more things I still wanted to do.

9
00:00:35.617 --> 00:00:38.825
"I want to go fishing," I said.

10
00:00:38.826 --> 00:00:43.077
"I want to go swimming in the lake," Molly added.

11
00:00:43.078 --> 00:00:48.081
"It's a little cold to go swimming," said Jenny.

12
00:00:48.082 --> 00:00:50.639
"But I want to collect fall leaves.

13
00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:53.953
We don't have all these trees in the city."

14
00:00:53.954 --> 00:00:58.386
"I'd like to explore the lookout tower again," said Josh.

15
00:00:58.387 --> 00:01:01.384
"Me too," said Caswell.

16
00:01:01.385 --> 00:01:06.532
"Maybe there's a hidden treasure there."

17
00:01:06.533 --> 00:01:10.612
"The hotel also has horses," said Molly.

18
00:01:10.613 --> 00:01:13.166
"We could go horseback riding."

19
00:01:13.167 --> 00:01:16.730
"We've had a lot of fun," said Mr. Chen.

20
00:01:16.731 --> 00:01:18.431
"But it's time to go.

21
00:01:18.432 --> 00:01:21.795
Remember, I have to look for a new job."

22
00:01:21.796 --> 00:01:24.111
Josh's face fell.

23
00:01:24.112 --> 00:01:27.150
"I forgot about that," he said.

24
00:01:27.151 --> 00:01:29.001
I had forgotten too.

25
00:01:29.002 --> 00:01:35.298
Now I felt bad, thinking about Mr. Chen losing his job.

26
00:01:35.299 --> 00:01:40.754
"I hope we don't have to move to Ohio," said Josh.

27
00:01:40.755 --> 00:01:44.269
"That would be awful," I said.

28
00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:47.863
"Let's not think about it," said Jenny.

29
00:01:47.864 --> 00:01:51.156
We went upstairs to pack.

30
00:01:51.157 --> 00:01:57.073
As soon as we opened the door, Bunch started barking at the red curtains.

31
00:01:57.074 --> 00:02:01.415
Everyone else started sniffing the air.

32
00:02:01.416 --> 00:02:05.434
"Something smells funny in here," said Molly.

33
00:02:05.435 --> 00:02:09.591
I nodded. Something did smell weird.

34
00:02:09.592 --> 00:02:13.397
"It smells like something rotten," added Josh.

35
00:02:13.398 --> 00:02:19.040
"Let's find out where it's coming from," Mr. Chen said.

36
00:02:19.041 --> 00:02:21.343
We all started looking.

37
00:02:21.344 --> 00:02:24.624
Jenny and Caswell looked in the closet.

38
00:02:24.625 --> 00:02:28.725
Josh and Mr. Chen searched under the couch.

39
00:02:28.726 --> 00:02:33.275
I looked behind the bathroom door, and Molly looked under her bed.

40
00:02:33.276 --> 00:02:37.846
"Oh my gosh!" she cried. "Look!"

41
00:02:37.847 --> 00:02:40.537
We all went over and looked under the bed.

42
00:02:40.538 --> 00:02:44.412
All of us except Caswell.

43
00:02:44.413 --> 00:02:47.114
He hid in the closet.

44
00:02:47.115 --> 00:02:51.855
Molly pulled out Caswell's teddy bear backpack.

45
00:02:51.856 --> 00:02:56.709
It was filled with wilted and smelly vegetables.

46
00:02:56.710 --> 00:03:01.664
"Those are the missing vegetables from the parade!" said Jenny.

47
00:03:01.665 --> 00:03:05.551
"They don't look very healthy anymore," said Josh.

48
00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:08.726
Mr. Chen shook his head in bewilderment.

49
00:03:08.727 --> 00:03:13.004
"How on earth did they get there?" he asked.

50
00:03:13.005 --> 00:03:17.257
We all looked at the closet where Caswell was hiding.

51
00:03:17.258 --> 00:03:23.554
"Caswell," called Molly. "Come out here!"

52
00:03:23.555 --> 00:03:25.973
Caswell came out of the closet.

53
00:03:25.974 --> 00:03:28.170
He was hanging his head.

54
00:03:28.171 --> 00:03:32.438
"Caswell, did you take these vegetables?" asked Molly.

55
00:03:32.439 --> 00:03:36.686
"I don't like vegetables," said Caswell.

56
00:03:36.687 --> 00:03:41.129
"I was afraid I'd have to eat vegetable soup."

57
00:03:41.130 --> 00:03:45.004
"So you hid them under my bed?" asked Molly.

58
00:03:45.005 --> 00:03:47.100
Caswell nodded.

59
00:03:47.101 --> 00:03:50.777
"Caswell, that was wrong," said Molly.

60
00:03:50.778 --> 00:03:56.956
"He must have taken them yesterday after we went to the lookout tower," said Jenny.

61
00:03:56.957 --> 00:04:02.420
"He did it when I went to get a blanket from the front desk!" added Mr. Chen.

62
00:04:02.421 --> 00:04:05.762
"I was only gone for about ten minutes."

63
00:04:05.763 --> 00:04:11.292
"Should we tell Mr. Scary we found the vegetables?" I asked Mr. Chen.

64
00:04:11.293 --> 00:04:16.459
Before Mr. Chen could answer, Mr. Scary stepped into the room.

65
00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:20.804
"I heard everything!" the hotel manager said.

66
00:04:20.805 --> 00:04:24.159
He pointed to the wilted vegetables.

67
00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:28.749
"I know who took the vegetables!"

68
00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:32.797
I gulped, and so did Molly.

69
00:04:32.798 --> 00:04:37.737
"Caswell didn't mean to spoil the vegetable parade," she said quickly.

70
00:04:37.738 --> 00:04:42.546
"We will be happy to pay for the vegetables," added Mr. Chen.

71
00:04:42.547 --> 00:04:46.241
Mr. Scary's expression didn't change.

72
00:04:46.242 --> 00:04:49.844
He still stared sternly at us.

73
00:04:49.845 --> 00:04:58.808
I closed my eyes, waiting to hear what he was about to say next.

